#--------------------------------------------------------------------
#  PRIMO Macro v1.0
#
#  Macro: PRIMOMacro_SourcePSF
#  Purpose: Simulate segment s1 and tally a phase space file.
#  Requirements:
#    - An existing project with a linac set in an operational mode
#  Adjust to your requirements:
#   - beam parameters  {set to the default of the first nominal energy}
#   - simulation parameters {10^9 histories}
#
#  last update: March, 2018
#-------------------------------------------------------------------
# steps:
# 1- Remove any ct, plan and structures in the project
#     by creating a water phantom w/ default dimensions
# 2- Set the beam to the default values of the first nominal energy
# 3- Set the simulation params for segment s1 
# 4- Variance reduction = splitting roulette (radius for a 40x40 cm2 field)
# 5- Do simulate
#-------------------------------------------------------------------

phantom \mats=water \thicks=30.0
config.beam \nominal=1 
config.simu  \engine=penelope \histories=1000000000 \seeds \cpus=4
config.vr \roulettefull
simulate

# end-of-macro -----------------------------------------------------


